 * [[File:Dota2 Queen of Pain Sonic Wave Visualization icon-1.png|105px|]][[File:Dota2 Queen of Pain Sonic Wave Visualization icon-2.png|105px|]]
** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Sonic Wave value2}}+{{#var:Sonic Wave value3}}}}-distance away with the travel distance and end radius.
*** The ability's starts at Akasha's current position [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}}, with the first radius extending to point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] .
**** The total ability [[area-of-effect]] is cone-shaped.
**** {{Code|OP {{=}} {{#var:Sonic Wave value1}}}}
**** {{Code|PQ {{=}} {{#var:Sonic Wave value2}}}}
*** Circle [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] is the end radius.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** The wave travels at {{#var:Sonic Wave basic1}}-speed, reaching max distance in {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Sonic Wave basic1}}/{{#var:Sonic Wave value2}}}} seconds.
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|queenofpain_sonic_wave_damage}}
**#* Deals {{calc|v1/{{#var:Sonic Wave value6}}*{{#var:Sonic Wave basic2}} round2|v1={{#var:Sonic Wave value5}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1/{{#var:Sonic Wave value6}}*{{#var:Sonic Wave basic2}} round2|v1={{#var:Sonic Wave value5 tal}}}}|25tal}}) {{M|pure}} {{M|spell damage}} in {{#var:Sonic Wave basic2}}-second intervals, over {{#expr:{{#var:Sonic Wave value6}}/{{#var:Sonic Wave basic2}}}} damage instances, starting immediately upon debuff application.
**#* {{M|Status resistance}} sources reduce the {{M|knockback}} duration, but increases the spell damage value per interval.
**#* Reapplying this ability component applies an independent debuff instance.
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|queenofpain_sonic_wave_knockback}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Knockback|Behind}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}}
**#* Applies a non-disabling fixed {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#var:Sonic Wave value4}}-distance {{M|knockback}} to all affected units from their current location, corresponding to their {{M|facing angle}}, over the entire debuff duration.
**#** Reapplying this ability component refreshes its duration.
**#* The knockback duration varies depending on the terrain.
**#* Can push enemy units over {{M|impassable terrain}}.
**#* {{Symbol|Trees}} 
**#** [[Trees]] within a 200-radius centered around all debuff-affected enemy units are destroyed.

* Affects the following units:
** {{M|Couriers}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Sonic Wave icon0}}
| desc = Creates a gigantic wave of sound in front of Queen of Pain, dealing heavy damage to all enemy units in its wake and pushing them back.
}}
* {{cf|Cos}} Applies the following additional debuffs to affected enemy units with the {{Cl|Eminence of Ristul|Queen of Pain}} equipped:
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|queenofpain_sonic_wave_delay}} {{to}} {{Symbol|fx|v}} {{Symbol|Model Size}}
*** Applies a dark red hue on all debuff-affected unit's model.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|queenofpain_arcana_kill_effect}}
*** Has a 0.27-second effect delay duration.
**** Grants Akasha a 3-second kill status effect upon killing the debuff-affected enemy hero.
**** Considers {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.

